Type: Package
Package: betanorm
Title: Quantile and Beta-Mixture Microarray Normalization
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("Hung", "Pham", , "amser.hoanghung@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8271-9355"))
Description: Provides quantile normalization that maps each sample onto a
    target distribution (requiring complete data), and beta-mixture
    quantile ('BMIQ') calibration of DNA methylation beta values to a
    gold-standard profile. Default expectation-maximization settings,
    including a small iteration cap, follow common legacy 'BMIQ'
    implementations for compatibility rather than as a recommended
    statistical default. Quantile normalization follows Bolstad, Irizarry,
    Astrand and Speed (2003) <doi:10.1093/bioinformatics/19.2.185> and
    beta-mixture quantile normalization follows Teschendorff, Marabita,
    Lechner, Bartlett, Tegner, Gomez-Cabrero and Beck (2013)
    <doi:10.1093/bioinformatics/bts680>.
